shape: sequence_diagram

classes: {
  logic: {
    style.fill: "#dae8fc"
    style.stroke: "#6c8ebf"
    style.font-size: 22
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }
  external: {
    style.fill: "#d5e8d4"
    style.stroke: "#82b366"
    shape: cloud
    style.font-size: 22
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }
}

Groq.class: external
HybridRetriever.class: logic
RelevanceCheck.class: logic

Frontend -> SearchLoop: search(query)

note over SearchLoop: ITERATION 1

SearchLoop -> HyDE: build_hyde_prompt(query)
HyDE -> SearchLoop: system + user prompt
SearchLoop -> Groq: chat(hyde_messages) via Paritok proxy
Groq -> SearchLoop: hypothetical_case_report
SearchLoop -> HybridRetriever: search(query, secondary_query=case_report, top_k=5)
note over HybridRetriever: BM25 (0.5) + vector (0.5) per query\nprimary 60% + secondary 40% weighted blend\nrarity boost: rare papers x1.6, common papers x1.0
HybridRetriever -> SearchLoop: papers_ranked
SearchLoop -> RelevanceCheck: run_relevance_check_batch(query, papers)
RelevanceCheck -> Groq: chat(batch_prompt) via Paritok proxy
Groq -> RelevanceCheck: relevance judgments (JSON)
RelevanceCheck -> SearchLoop: results (relevant_papers_dict)
SearchLoop -> SearchLoop: relevant_count = count(relevant_papers)
note over SearchLoop: check: relevant_count >= 2?\nbelow: only runs if this check fails

SearchLoop -> Groq: chat(refine_prompt) via Paritok proxy
note over SearchLoop: historical context inflation: prior reasoning appended for iteration 2
Groq -> SearchLoop: refined_query

note over SearchLoop: ITERATION 2 (max_iterations=2, so final)

SearchLoop -> HyDE: build_hyde_prompt(refined_query)
note over HyDE: user prompt includes prior_reasoning:\ncarried history from iteration 1
HyDE -> SearchLoop: system + user prompt with history
SearchLoop -> Groq: chat(hyde_messages) via Paritok proxy
Groq -> SearchLoop: hypothetical_case_report
SearchLoop -> HybridRetriever: search(refined_query, secondary_query=case_report, top_k=5)
HybridRetriever -> SearchLoop: papers_ranked
SearchLoop -> RelevanceCheck: run_relevance_check_batch(refined_query, papers)
RelevanceCheck -> Groq: chat(batch_prompt) via Paritok proxy
Groq -> RelevanceCheck: relevance judgments (JSON)
RelevanceCheck -> SearchLoop: results (relevant_papers_dict)
SearchLoop -> SearchLoop: relevant_count = count(relevant_papers)
note over SearchLoop: final iteration reached, return papers

SearchLoop -> Frontend: return(relevant_papers, trace_log)
